---
import '../styles/global.css';
import fotosantri from '../assets/fotosantri.png';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-24 overflow-hidden mt-12">
  
  <!-- This grid container will stack them on mobile and put them side-by-side on desktop -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

    <!-- Left Column: The Image Layout -->
    <div class="relative flex justify-center pt-16 md:pt-24">

      <!-- 1. The Background Text (REVIEWS) - Bottom Layer -->
      <!-- Positioned absolutely at the top, horizontally centered -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-0">
        <h2 class="text-[6.5rem] md:text-[8.5rem] font-black text-green-500 leading-none tracking-tighter uppercase m-0 select-none">
          Siap?
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. The Dark Gray Box - Middle Layer -->
      <!-- Starts about 30% down to let the head overlap the text, goes to the bottom -->
      <div class="absolute top-[25%] md:top-[30%] bottom-0 left-2 right-2 md:-left-4 md:-right-4 bg-[#333333] z-10"></div>

      <!-- 3. The Girl Image - Top Layer -->
      <!-- Using object-contain and z-20 to ensure she pops out of the dark box -->
      <Image
        src={fotosantri}
        alt="Siswa PPMHS"
        class="relative z-20 w-full max-w-[280px] md:max-w-[340px] object-contain drop-shadow-2xl"
      />

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: The Review Text -->
    <!-- Added 'relative' so z-20 works, ensuring it sits on top if there's any overlap -->
    <div class="relative z-20 px-2 md:px-0">
      
      <!-- We removed the frosted glass background to match the clean reference -->
      <p class="text-[17px] md:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 leading-[1.7]">
        "PPMHS menyediakan lingkungan yang luar biasa untuk belajar. Kurikulum dan metodenya memicu pemikiran kritis dan memberdayakan saya untuk berani berpendapat dalam forum besar. Saya sangat bersyukur atas ilmu dan nilai-nilai agama yang diberikan oleh para guru. Pengalaman saya sebagai orang tua semakin melipatgandakan apresiasi saya saat melihat pikiran dan hati anak-anak saya berkembang di lingkungan ini."
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-[15px] md:text-base text-gray-700 font-medium">
        - Katherine D., Alumna & Orang Tua Siswa
      </p>

    </div>
  
  </div> <!-- End of grid container -->

</section>